The shadcn/ui primitives in this directory (alert.tsx, avatar.tsx, badge.tsx,
button.tsx, card.tsx, checkbox.tsx, dialog.tsx, input.tsx, label.tsx,
progress.tsx, select.tsx, separator.tsx, sheet.tsx, sonner.tsx, table.tsx,
tabs.tsx, textarea.tsx, tooltip.tsx) are vendored from shadcn-ui/ui,
`apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/ui/` at revision
8720dec73f5aebed9f649ea58636f54599fdedf1, under the MIT License below.
Local modifications are limited to documented branding patches
(`font-heading tracking-tight` on CardTitle/DialogTitle), import-path
normalization, and the sonner.tsx host integration (foundation useColorMode
in place of next-themes). Unused recipe exports (buttonVariants,
badgeVariants, tabsListVariants) were made module-internal.

